   "versionNonce": 775813381,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• the first systematic map of NLP for\n  the whole family (101 codes)\n\n• beyond paper counts: an audit of\n  corpora, Wikipedia, morphology,\n  LID and parallel data\n\n• conservative wording: 'not found'\n  rather than 'does not exist'\n\n• concrete, low-cost priorities, plus a\n  companion website and public code",
   "fontSize": 23,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "• the first systematic map of NLP for\n  the whole family (101 codes)\n\n• beyond paper counts: an audit of\n  corpora, Wikipedia, morphology,\n  LID and parallel data\n\n• conservative wording: 'not found'\n  rather than 'does not exist'\n\n• concrete, low-cost priorities, plus a\n  companion website and public code",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
